    <briefdescription>
<para>Heuristic thought generator that appends numbered reasoning steps. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Produces deterministic outputs useful for testing without an LLM. Each generated thought has the form: &quot;Consider approach &lt;depth&gt;.&lt;i&gt;: &lt;problem excerpt&gt;&quot; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
